{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "309b2fd23b891750c72a307bbb59e08f98bbfd1b3919d0db35900c9cfabce2f4", "ja": "（バレンタインを間近に控え、やよいは『お菓子』を\nテーマにした洋服の撮影を行った！）", "zh": "（临近情人节，弥生拍摄了以“点心”为主题的服装！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "df3fc3b1a5e254b88ee236f84ac89e4b120403ac947990003d7c4bbce0ee4e28", "ja": "うっうー！　{$P$}、お疲れさま\nです！　今日の撮影、とーっても楽しかったです！", "zh": "呜～呜～！　{$P$}，辛苦您\n了！　今天的拍摄，非～常开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6db94a2f29c9a10660f56b1c5bc997c59e71341dd4d270f5983af35656855a03", "ja": "お疲れさま、やよい。うん、撮影中の笑顔で\n伝わってきてたよ。楽しかったのならなによりだ。", "zh": "辛苦了，弥生。嗯，从拍摄时你的笑容里就看出来了。你觉得开心就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "931e26ce28210fd38ec3de768db5766b712919f3a476e0f8fe58fee210e94c16", "ja": "えへへ。セットが本当にすーっごく素敵で！\nお菓子に囲まれて、夢みたいな時間でした♪", "zh": "嘿嘿。布景真的特别特别漂亮！被各种甜点包围着，度过了一段像做梦一样的时光♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "de28d113a4eabdb9d1b4a9d441f3bd922a47a4fe1e75de27ffa1ff1035d82eff", "ja": "全部おいしそうでしたよね！\nチョコに、クッキーに、キャンディに、ドーナツ……！", "zh": "看起来全都好好吃呢！\n巧克力、饼干、糖果、甜甜圈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e7a361814022893d90d5a0911849df555a86d33c52cad01e5a1cda5d90811909", "ja": "食べてみたいのか？\nだったら、もらってくるよ。", "zh": "你想吃吗？那我去拿一些来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "12a7ab09d0012b7dd954fa5e07fbb22f52b6311008847ce3c000fd31ad1b641c", "ja": "え、いいんですか！？\n撮影用だから、食べられないんじゃ……。", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？\n这是拍摄用的，应该不能吃吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d151e9910c3a11c7da617b54422b4b78014e64168caa708590d13b11361a9df5", "ja": "そんなことはないよ。後でスタッフさんたちで\n食べるつもりだったみたいだし。", "zh": "没那回事。听说本来就是打算之后让工作人员吃的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9bad6519d1b7172d142ef6dd2c612cb3624bdffd43740627540855c9b7f8abe5", "ja": "あれだけの量だし、やよいがもらっても困らない\n……どころか、助かるくらいじゃないかな。", "zh": "有那么大的分量，就算弥生拿走也不会困扰\n……不如说，反倒帮了大忙才对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "0cc4bd5f04c563f4a0199e68ad5a3dcc580fd7779845838f7f742b7e178a2269", "ja": "本当ですか？　じゃあ、お腹いーっぱい！\nになるまで、{$P$}も一緒に……！", "zh": "真的吗？那就一起吃到肚子饱饱的，{$P$}也一起来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "cd8e071df0964ed1b2ca08025366143afd3c26bf8bf9475051cde8abb9314037", "ja": "あ……でも、{$P$}が\nお腹いっぱいになるのは、困るかも……。", "zh": "啊……不过，要是{$P$}吃饱了，可能会有点麻烦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1a6947003669ccbbf1b32be1bc78bf59cad264d2e618663c5ebe838719178ae8", "ja": "え、そうなのか？", "zh": "诶，是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "cfce904582ea765eb12f043e9f451ef1caa44909e806c22a9f139aa3dd2d4556", "ja": "えっと……実は今日、{$P$}に\nサプライズをしようと思ってて……。", "zh": "那个……其实今天，我想给{$P$}一个惊喜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "500a577a2f5257546dbe52224d89fbdda9dea3fd2c8dc0221787ccb317e8614e", "ja": "バレンタインのチョコレート、持ってきたんです……。\nこの撮影が終わったら、渡そうかなーって。", "zh": "我带来了情人节的巧克力……  \n想着等拍摄结束后，要不要送给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bbf9702e56dd33887fe693d5ba6b9221d5ba3e0a095592b24fd24b9e1618e384", "ja": "サプライズ……。\nなるほど確かに、お腹いっぱいになると困るな。", "zh": "惊喜……。\n原来如此，确实，要是吃饱了就不好办了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "91f4a507daf4c172f1eda82ae00917e0a3b007f570c30ce8f7c8dd0337cee520", "ja": "はい……。あっ！　でも、気にしないでください！　\n私のチョコは、家に帰ってからでも食べられますしっ！", "zh": "是……啊！不过，请不用在意！  \n我的巧克力，回家后再吃也可以！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d853c1fa95f767a6aca3ad5443454e4fed8c232cfc4dae99942f29adb1f0f3f3", "ja": "それはそうだけど……個人的には、やよいが\n持ってきてくれたチョコレートが一番食べたいかな。", "zh": "话是这么说没错……不过就我个人而言，最想吃的还是弥生带来的巧克力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "a13bbc09cc2e66f60141a5d15ad98cce0aa8f87fb66daf245acc73b0cb9a5f62", "ja": "え、いいんですか？　だってここのお菓子、\nあんなにおいしそうなのに……。", "zh": "诶，可以吗？这里的点心明明看起来那么好吃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1018_p", "source_sha256": "257a0ff164f9936458223a03aca7517e3cb85ccfa05c109d6d484cf67a20d88b", "ja": "確かにおいしそうだけど、やよいが用意してくれた\nチョコのほうが気になるんだ。どうかな？", "zh": "确实看起来很好吃，但我更想尝尝やよい准备的巧克力。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "32b5165a259c88231ac7dccce75ac7a2980053906f2205c14cad1ac0c27eabe3", "ja": "{$P$}……\nありがとうございます！　すっごくうれしいです！", "zh": "{$P$}……\n谢谢您！我特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0444_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "9c56515419fdcb3c5d41b5d9fd81cb3447c31a08c962c4aa3c03ae526cba6cba", "ja": "じゃあ、すぐに持ってきますね！　いーっぱい思いを\n込めて作ったからおいしかったらいいなぁ！　えへへ♪", "zh": "那我马上拿过来！因为是倾注了满满心意做出来的，要是觉得好吃就好了！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
